      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "GlobeView.tsx  - CORE COMPONENT\nmode: 'satellite-tracker' | 'orbital-intelligence'   (1409 lines - the heart of the UI)\n* globe.gl + three.js  -> WebGL interactive 3D Earth (points, objects, paths, polygons)\n* satellite.js -> CLIENT-SIDE SGP4:  twoline2satrec -> propagate -> eciToGeodetic / gstime\n* 1-second propagation loop animates live positions; orbit trails (~90 min paths)\n* topojson-client + world-atlas -> country borders; day/night, atmosphere, clouds, graticules\n* builds feature points [alt, inclination, mean-motion] -> sends to clustering",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r_x4hh5344tf",
      "originalText": "GlobeView.tsx  - CORE COMPONENT\nmode: 'satellite-tracker' | 'orbital-intelligence'   (1409 lines - the heart of the UI)\n* globe.gl + three.js  -> WebGL interactive 3D Earth (points, objects, paths, polygons)\n* satellite.js -> CLIENT-SIDE SGP4:  twoline2satrec -> propagate -> eciToGeodetic / gstime\n* 1-second propagation loop animates live positions; orbit trails (~90 min paths)\n* topojson-client + world-atlas -> country borders; day/night, atmosphere, clouds, graticules\n* builds feature points [alt, inclination, mean-motion] -> sends to clustering",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
