      "originalText": "SatelliteService\n* curated 'popular' list (ISS, Hubble, CSS,\n  NOAA, Landsat)\n* CelesTrak group routing: STARLINK, GPS-OPS,\n  GALILEO, BEIDOU, IRIDIUM, NOAA, GOES...\n* in-memory caches: TLE 1h . list 15m\n* trails + parallel batch positions\n* fallback chain CelesTrak -> TLE API",
      "autoResize": false,
