      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "scikit-learn algorithms\n* KMeans - k clusters, returns labels + inertia\n* DBSCAN - eps + min_samples, density clusters\n  + noise/outlier count\n* IsolationForest - contamination, anomaly\n  detection (inlier / outlier labels)\nreturns labels, nClusters, inertia, noiseCount",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r_sg5lo50djz",
      "originalText": "scikit-learn algorithms\n* KMeans - k clusters, returns labels + inertia\n* DBSCAN - eps + min_samples, density clusters\n  + noise/outlier count\n* IsolationForest - contamination, anomaly\n  detection (inlier / outlier labels)\nreturns labels, nClusters, inertia, noiseCount",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
