      "seed": 1889882673,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1089694565,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "1) Browser loads a Next.js route -> GlobeView renders the globe.gl / three.js Earth and starts a 1-second satellite.js SGP4 loop.\n2) lib/api.ts calls same-origin /api/* -> Next rewrite proxies to Spring Boot (:8080).\n3) SatelliteService fetches TLEs (CelesTrak -> TLE-API fallback, cached) and can propagate locally with predict4java.\n4) Clustering: OrbitalAnalyticsPanel -> /api/analytics/cluster -> Spring WebClient -> Python FastAPI (scikit-learn) -> labels back to globe.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Browser loads a Next.js route -> GlobeView renders the globe.gl / three.js Earth and starts a 1-second satellite.js SGP4 loop.\n2) lib/api.ts calls same-origin /api/* -> Next rewrite proxies to Spring Boot (:8080).\n3) SatelliteService fetches TLEs (CelesTrak -> TLE-API fallback, cached) and can propagate locally with predict4java.\n4) Clustering: OrbitalAnalyticsPanel -> /api/analytics/cluster -> Spring WebClient -> Python FastAPI (scikit-learn) -> labels back to globe.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
